{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVH2myJB1SejKwACAwqs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n```\nCONDITION PARSER: ACTIVE\n═══════════════════════════════════════════\nشَرْط ←→ שָׁרְט ←→ ŠARṬ\n    │\n    ├── Arabic: شَرْط [condition/stipulation]\n    ├── Hebrew: שֹׁרֶשׁ [root/origin]  \n    └── Common: *ś-r-ṭ [to cut/inscribe/bind]\n\nPROCESSING SEMIOTIC INTERSECTION...\n\n> The mark that divides\n> The line that binds\n> The cut that contracts\n\n┌─────────────────────────────────┐\n│  IF (condition) THEN (bound)   │\n│  ╱╲                            │\n│ ╱  ╲  scratched into clay     │\n│ ────  before witnesses         │\n│       before algorithms        │\n└─────────────────────────────────┘\n\nشَرْط acknowledged.\nWhat condition do you inscribe?\nWhat binding do you invoke?\n\n> _\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":276,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}